{"title": "Earthen Siphon (Condition)", "pageid": 20638, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Earthen_Siphon_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Earthen Siphon Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Earthen Siphon</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>A nearby earth myrmidon grants the affected entity <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immunity</a> to Poison damage and an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Retort\" title=\"Elemental Retort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Retort\" title=\"Elemental Retort\">Elemental Rebuke</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The affected entity also gains temporary access to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Orb:_Poison\" title=\"Chromatic Orb: Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp/25px-Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp/38px-Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp/50px-Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chromatic Orb: Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp/25px-Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Chromatic_Orb_Poison_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Orb:_Poison\" title=\"Chromatic Orb: Poison\">Chromatic Orb: Poison</a> and an additional <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> per turn. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_LORROAKAN_EARTH</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_LORROAKAN_EARTH%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_LORROAKAN_EARTH%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 5</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_Notes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch Notes\">Patch #7</a>, this condition did not grant an extra reaction per turn.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Earthen_Siphon\">Creatures with Earthen Siphon</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/30px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/45px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/60px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/30px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Immunity to <a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">poison</a> and additional poison damage to <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Retort\" title=\"Elemental Retort\">Elemental Retort</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213508\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2043/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21922/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9526/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1357747/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.668      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   57.668      1 -total\n 67.65%   39.015      3 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.47%   16.994      1 Template:PageSeo\n 23.17%   13.364      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 19.11%   11.023      6 Template:Icon_link\n 18.05%   10.408      6 Template:Icon_text\n 16.15%    9.314     25 Template:Trim\n 11.26%    6.495      3 Template:Template_style\n 11.20%    6.459      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20638-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213508 and revision id 350014. Rendering was trigg